  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "With ADEPTA SORORITAS as your Army Faction, each of your units that has Acts of Faith may use it once per phase. Gain one Miracle die at every turn’s start and one whenever you lose an ADEPTA SORORITAS unit. Roll a D6 per die gained. Keep the resulting Miracle dice in your pool. Its value stays fixed unless a rule permits a change or re-roll. Before the unit or one of its models rolls, decide whether to substitute one saved die. The permitted rolls are Advance, Battle-shock, Charge, Damage, Hit, saving throw and Wound. Even on a multiple-die roll, use only one Miracle die. Roll the other dice normally. The substituted value counts as unmodified. Remove the die from the pool when spent. For example, spending a stored 4 changes a 2D6 Battle-shock test to D6+4.",
